# DOCTOR-style script for this project's ELIZA engine.
# This is a RECREATED script inspired by Joseph Weizenbaum's 1966 DOCTOR (Rogerian therapist).
# It is NOT the original historical script; rules and replies here are written for this project.
# Format: key: word [rank] / decomp: pattern (* = any words, @group = synonym word) / reasmb: reply ((n) = nth capture, goto KEY, newkey).

initial: How do you do. Please tell me your problem.
final: Goodbye. Thank you for talking to me.

quit: bye
quit: goodbye
quit: quit
quit: exit

