  decomp: * @family *
    reasmb: Tell me more about your (2).
    reasmb: How do you feel about your (2)?
    reasmb: What is your relationship with your (2) like?
    reasmb: Does your (2) have anything to do with how you feel?
    reasmb: What comes to mind when you think of your (2)?

